From 168644533b3f388c1236338ef027076abbb975c7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Natalie Vock <natalie.vock@gmx.de>
Date: Wed, 1 Jul 2026 11:55:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [FOR-UPSTREAM] drm/ttm: Add ordered bulk moves

Ordered bulk moves maintain the list of resources in a user-defined
order, useful for example to implement priorities. U32_MAX is sometimes
treated as a special "unset priority" sentinel. An ordered bulk move
where all priorities are unset behaves exactly like an unordered bulk
move.

Signed-off-by: Natalie Vock <natalie.vock@gmx.de>
Signed-off-by: Henry Paradiz <henry.paradiz@gmail.com>
